msgstr "``event of call … skipped - <reason>``"

#: ../../integration/mango/monitoring.rst:74
msgid ""
"Уведомление пропущено (исходящий или пропущенный звонок, уведомление о "
"статусе записи и т. п.)"
msgstr ""
"The notification was skipped (outgoing or missed call, recording status "
"notification, etc.)"

#: ../../integration/mango/monitoring.rst:75
msgid "``gives no phone key``"
msgstr "``gives no phone key``"

#: ../../integration/mango/monitoring.rst:77
msgid ""
"Из номера не получен нормализованный номер (скрытый или короткий номер)"
msgstr ""
"No normalized number was obtained from the number (hidden or short number)"

#: ../../integration/mango/monitoring.rst:78
msgid "``resolved to no target``"
msgstr "``resolved to no target``"

#: ../../integration/mango/monitoring.rst:80
msgid "Сделка или лид не найдены и не созданы, активность не создана"
msgstr "No deal or lead was found or created, no activity was created"

#: ../../integration/mango/monitoring.rst:81
msgid "``is queued for``"
msgstr "``is queued for``"

#: ../../integration/mango/monitoring.rst:83
msgid "Звонок поставлен в очередь на загрузку аудиозаписи"
msgstr "The call has been queued for recording download"

#: ../../integration/mango/monitoring.rst:84
msgid "``is downloaded, N bytes``"
msgstr "``is downloaded, N bytes``"

#: ../../integration/mango/monitoring.rst:86
msgid "Аудиозапись загружена"
msgstr "The recording has been downloaded"

#: ../../integration/mango/monitoring.rst:87
msgid "``is transcribed``"
msgstr "``is transcribed``"

#: ../../integration/mango/monitoring.rst:89
msgid "Аудиозапись распознана"
msgstr "The recording has been recognized"

#: ../../integration/mango/monitoring.rst:90
msgid "``has no transcription to summarize``"
msgstr "``has no transcription to summarize``"

#: ../../integration/mango/monitoring.rst:92
msgid "Расшифровка пуста, резюме не запрашивалось"
msgstr "The transcript is empty, no summary was requested"

#: ../../integration/mango/monitoring.rst:93
msgid "``event is dropped``"
msgstr "``event is dropped``"

#: ../../integration/mango/monitoring.rst:95
msgid ""
"Уведомление о записи пришло для звонка без активности и отброшено; для "
"исходящих, внутренних и пропущенных звонков с аудиозаписью это штатная "
"ситуация"
msgstr ""
"A recording notification arrived for a call without an activity and was "
"discarded; for outgoing, internal, and missed calls with a recording, this"
" is normal"

#: ../../integration/mango/monitoring.rst:96
msgid "``the record/added of recording … is dropped``"
msgstr "``the record/added of recording … is dropped``"

#: ../../integration/mango/monitoring.rst:98
msgid ""
"Аудиозапись звонка уже сохранена; повторное уведомление или аудиозапись "
"второго участка переведённого звонка отброшены"
msgstr ""
"The call recording has already been saved; a repeated notification or the "
"recording of the second part of a transferred call was discarded"

#: ../../integration/mango/monitoring.rst:99
msgid "``scheduled for retry N in M ms``"
msgstr "``scheduled for retry N in M ms``"

#: ../../integration/mango/monitoring.rst:101
msgid "Запланирован отложенный повтор обработки аудиозаписи"
msgstr "A delayed retry of recording processing has been scheduled"

#: ../../integration/mango/monitoring.rst:102
msgid "``matched several records``"
msgstr "``matched several records``"

#: ../../integration/mango/monitoring.rst:103
#: ../../integration/mango/monitoring.rst:106
#: ../../integration/mango/monitoring.rst:109
#: ../../integration/mango/monitoring.rst:112
#: ../../integration/mango/monitoring.rst:115
